{"page":435,"width":1829,"height":2492,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"한다. 대개 이들 횟수는 자료의 초기화 여부에 의존적이다. 일반적으로 이동 횟수와 비교 횟수가","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":400,"y":204,"width":66,"height":33},{"text":"대개","x":482,"y":204,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"이들","x":550,"y":204,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"횟수는","x":618,"y":205,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"자료의","x":714,"y":206,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"초기화","x":809,"y":208,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"여부에","x":905,"y":208,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"의존적이다.","x":1003,"y":208,"width":151,"height":32},{"text":"일반적으로","x":1171,"y":207,"width":149,"height":33},{"text":"이동","x":1333,"y":207,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"횟수와","x":1405,"y":206,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"비교","x":1508,"y":206,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"횟수가","x":1578,"y":207,"width":86,"height":34}]},{"text":"서로 비례하지 않는다. 즉 어떤 알고리즘은 비교 횟수는 많지\\새 이동 횟수는 적을 수 있고 또 그","words":[{"text":"서로","x":401,"y":261,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"비례하지","x":472,"y":260,"width":110,"height":34},{"text":"않는다.","x":597,"y":261,"width":91,"height":32},{"text":"즉","x":704,"y":263,"width":28,"height":30},{"text":"어떤","x":744,"y":261,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":811,"y":262,"width":143,"height":34},{"text":"비교","x":966,"y":263,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"횟수는","x":1035,"y":263,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"많지\\새","x":1133,"y":263,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"이동","x":1235,"y":263,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"횟수는","x":1307,"y":264,"width":91,"height":33},{"text":"적을","x":1411,"y":264,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":1481,"y":264,"width":31,"height":32},{"text":"있고","x":1526,"y":263,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"또","x":1595,"y":267,"width":29,"height":25},{"text":"그","x":1636,"y":270,"width":28,"height":22}]},{"text":"반대도 기능하다. 숫자와 숫자를 비교히는 것은 시간이 걸리지 않지만 문자열과 문자열을 비교","words":[{"text":"반대도","x":401,"y":317,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"기능하다.","x":501,"y":316,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"숫자와","x":637,"y":3