"y":1165,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":1174,"y":1165,"width":148,"height":33},{"text":"구현하기가","x":1332,"y":1164,"width":155,"height":33},{"text":"쉬운","x":1498,"y":1164,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"대신에","x":1571,"y":1165,"width":87,"height":32}]},{"text":"비효율적이다. 반면 효율적인 알고리즘은 반대로 구현하기는 까다롭지만 효율적이다.","words":[{"text":"비효율적이다.","x":398,"y":1217,"width":180,"height":35},{"text":"반면","x":592,"y":1219,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"효율적인","x":659,"y":1220,"width":112,"height":32},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":782,"y":1220,"width":143,"height":32},{"text":"반대로","x":935,"y":1221,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"구현하기는","x":1029,"y":1221,"width":147,"height":32},{"text":"까다롭지만","x":1187,"y":1220,"width":149,"height":34},{"text":"효율적이다.","x":1344,"y":1219,"width":162,"height":33}]},{"text":"• 단순하지만 비효율적인 방법 - 삽입 정렬, 선택 정렬, 버블 정렬 등","words":[{"text":"•","x":406,"y":1312,"width":9,"height":8},{"text":"단순하지만","x":433,"y":1301,"width":146,"height":34},{"text":"비효율적인","x":589,"y":1302,"width":139,"height":33},{"text":"방법","x":739,"y":1303,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"-","x":806,"y":1318,"width":20,"height":3},{"text":"삽입","x":837,"y":1303,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"정렬,","x":905,"y":1304,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"선택","x":983,"y":1304,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"정렬,","x":1051,"y":1304,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"버블","x":1129,"y":1304,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"정렬","x":1199,"y":1303,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"등","x":1266,"y":1304,"width":30,"height":31}]},{"text":"• 복잡하지만 효율적인 방법 - 퀵 정렬, 히프 정렬, 합병 정렬, 기수 정렬 등","words":[{"text":"•","x":405,"y":1367,"width":9,"height":8},{"text":"복잡하지만","x":432,"y":1356,"width":146,"height":34},{"text":"효율적인","x":587,"y":1358,"width":113,"height":32},{"text":"방법","x":711,"y":1358,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"-","x":778,"y":1372,"width":18,"height":3},{"text":"퀵","x":809,"y":1358,"width":25,"height":32},{"text":"정렬,","x":848,"y":1358,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"히프","x":924,"y":1358,"width":57,"hei